Subject: [PATCH] v4l2codecs: allow the video converter fast path for HEVC cropping

Base: GStreamer tag 1.22.0
Base-commit: f13c65d977b740b5955343d320dcf2061bbdf62d
Source: https://github.com/GStreamer/gstreamer/blob/1.22.0/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codech265dec.c
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.0-or-later
Upstream copyright: 2020 Nicolas Dufresne <nicolas.dufresne@collabora.com>
Upstream copyright: 2020 Safran Passenger Innovations LLC

The crop converter disables dithering but sets its quantization to zero.
GstVideoConverter only considers fast paths when quantization is one, its
default. Restore that value so an NV12 crop can use the existing plane-copy
implementation instead of unpacking and repacking every pixel. Keep the
crop rectangle, output dimensions and disabled dithering unchanged.

This is a local one-line fix, not a backport of the later upstream change
e7be87b3de56e8c9922359c410b5c17864cbbf29, which avoids the crop converter
when the conformance window starts at the top-left corner.
---
 subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codech265dec.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codech265dec.c b/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codech265dec.c
--- a/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codech265dec.c
+++ b/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codech265dec.c
@@ -1098,7 +1098,7 @@ gst_v4l2_codec_h265_dec_crop_output_buffer (GstV4l2CodecH265Dec * self,
             GST_VIDEO_CONVERTER_OPT_DITHER_METHOD,
             GST_TYPE_VIDEO_DITHER_METHOD, GST_VIDEO_DITHER_NONE,
             GST_VIDEO_CONVERTER_OPT_DITHER_QUANTIZATION,
-            G_TYPE_UINT, 0,
+            G_TYPE_UINT, 1,
             GST_VIDEO_CONVERTER_OPT_CHROMA_MODE,
             GST_TYPE_VIDEO_CHROMA_MODE, GST_VIDEO_CHROMA_MODE_NONE,
             GST_VIDEO_CONVERTER_OPT_MATRIX_MODE,
